## State

[Zustand](https://github.com/pmndrs/zustand) example store at `src/store/useStore.js` (demoed by `src/components/CounterDemo.jsx`). Add your own state as a new store, one `create()` call per slice:

```js
// src/store/useUserPrefs.js
import { create } from "zustand";

export const useUserPrefs = create((set) => ({
  theme: "light",
  setTheme: (theme) => set({ theme }),
}));
```

```jsx
const { theme, setTheme } = useUserPrefs();
```

No provider needed — Zustand stores work standalone, just import the hook wherever you need it.

